The RECODe equations come from Sanjay Basu's repository
https://github.com/sanjaybasu/t2dmriskeqns (commit 63135bd8). That repository's
README states that the work is licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, and its LICENSE
file (added in 2020) is the MIT licence, Copyright (c) 2020 Sanjay Basu. This
package uses the more restrictive terms, which satisfy both: attribution to
the authors, non-commercial use only, and the same licence for adaptations.
The MIT notice is kept in inst/LICENSE-t2dmriskeqns-MIT.

Basu S, Sussman JB, Berkowitz SA, Hayward RA, Yudkin JS. Development and
validation of Risk Equations for Complications Of type 2 Diabetes (RECODe)
using individual participant data from randomised trials. Lancet Diabetes
Endocrinol 2017; 5: 788-98.
